# 41-session-restore: the same user dir as 40 - the collection comes back as a document (v2.5), then
# both tabs restore with their edits (v2.4 COL-09). The renamed tab's Save Configuration renames its
# source entry in place (h22): 40 renamed the Dipole tab to "My Dipole" and quit, and the session's
# persisted source ("Dipole") makes the restore keep that provenance across the restart.
collection.open Original
app.expect tabs=2
app.expect "title=My Dipole"
app.expect "title=Empty Configuration 1"
app.expect charges=1,2,0
app.wait-done
charge.move 0 0.1 0
app.expect dirty=1
config.save
app.expect dirty=0
app.expect configs=My Dipole|Two Equal Charges|Two Unequal Charges Same Sign|Two Unequal Charges Different Signs|Quadrupole|Four Charges Same Sign|Two Dipoles Same Direction|Two Dipoles Opposed Direction|Parallel Dipoles
tab.close
app.expect tabs=1
app.quit force
